 "Changes since then will be saved shortly.": "Los cambios desde entonces se van a guardar en un momento.",
 "The copy in your shared folder could not be read.": "No se pudo leer la copia de tu carpeta compartida.",
 "The copy in your shared folder is not an encrypted snapshot.": "La copia de tu carpeta compartida no es una copia cifrada.",
